  "description": "CR 614.1a, 400.3, 607.2a, 118.9, 601.3: Valgavoth, Terror Eater exiles a card headed to an opponent's graveyard that its controller didn't control, and its controller plays those cards during their own turn only, paying life equal to mana value",
  "note": "Pyroclasm kills six creatures. Bob's Grizzly Bears and carol's Spectral Sailor and Dryad Arbor go to exile. The Goblin Piker alice controls but bob owns goes to bob's graveyard (alice controlled it), and the Llanowar Elves bob controls but alice owns, alice's Raging Goblin and Pyroclasm go to alice's (no opponent's graveyard). Alice casts the Bears from exile for 2 life and no mana, plays the Arbor as her land, and can't cast the Shock bob had exiled before (not exiled with Valgavoth). On bob's turn the flash Sailor is refused; on her next turn it is cast for 1 life.",
